You can customize the active class with `active-class` and `exact-active-class` props. The default is `router-link-active`.

```html
<router-link to="/" active-class="active-link">Home</router-link>
```

In CSS:
```css
.router-link-active {
  font-weight: bold;
  color: #42b983;
}
```
